#blogify 

blogify is the full stack website to create blogs. it is a dynamic wedsite online platform featuring regularly updated content, called "posts," typically displayed in reverse chronological order (newest first), acting as an online journal or resource for sharing thoughts, expertise, news, or stories, and encouraging reader interaction through comments to build a community. 

Features
- you can register yourself to create blogs  
- then login to side and explore blogs 
- to create your personalised blog 
- see trend blogs and liked blogs 
